msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-phase-estimation/extracted-outputs/b0152311-8f60-4c11-a10e-a35691c0ece5-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-phase-estimation/extracted-outputs/b0152311-8f60-4c11-a10e-a35691c0ece5-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We see we get one result (`001`) with certainty, which translates to the decimal: `1`. We now need to divide our result (`1`) by $2^n$ to get $\\theta$:\n"
msgstr "نلاحظ أننا نحصل على نتيجة واحدة (`001`) بيقين تام، وهي تقابل العدد العشري: `1`. نحتاج الآن إلى قسمة نتيجتنا (`1`) على $2^n$ للحصول على $\\theta$:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta = \\frac{1}{2^3} = \\frac{1}{8}\n"
"$$\n"
" Shor's algorithm allows us to factorize a number by building a circuit with $\\theta$ unknown and obtaining $\\theta$.\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta = \\frac{1}{2^3} = \\frac{1}{8}\n"
"$$\n"
" تتيح لنا خوارزمية شور تحليل عدد إلى عوامل عن طريق بناء دارة بمعامل $\\theta$ مجهول والحصول على $\\theta$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "3.3 Exercise {#33-exercise}"
msgstr "3.3 تمرين {#33-exercise}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Estimate $\\theta = 1/3$ using 3 qubits for counting and a qubit for an eigenvector.\n"
msgstr "قدِّر $\\theta = 1/3$ باستخدام 3 كيوبتات للعدّ وكيوبت واحد لمتجه القيم الذاتية.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$P|1\\rangle = e^{i\\lambda}|1\\rangle$. Since we want to implement $U|1\\rangle = e^{2\\pi i \\tfrac{1}{3}}|1\\rangle$, we need to set $\\lambda = \\tfrac{2 \\pi}{3}$.\n"
msgstr "$P|1\\rangle = e^{i\\lambda}|1\\rangle$. بما أننا نريد تطبيق $U|1\\rangle = e^{2\\pi i \\tfrac{1}{3}}|1\\rangle$، علينا ضبط $\\lambda = \\tfrac{2 \\pi}{3}$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
